{#- Automatic blocks of the game pages. A page file (weekly/games/<date>/snapshot.md, analysis.md) calls them as {{ name }};
    see notebooks/pages.py. Each macro takes (a, files, author, kind): the generated data of the game, the names of the
    generated images of the page, the author and the kind of page. A macro named <kind>_<name> wins over <name>. -#}
{% from '_macros.j2' import roster_table %}

{# ─── snapshot ─── #}
{% macro snapshot_header(a, files, author, kind) -%}
{{ a.competition }}{% if a.round %} round {{ a.round }}{% endif %} · {{ a.date_long }}{% if a.time %}, {{ a.time }}{% endif %}{% if a.venue %} · {{ a.venue }}{% endif %}

**Pre-game snapshot: only data from games played before {{ a.date_long }}, in both competitions.**
{% if a.opponent_link %}The analysis of the opponent is [here]({{ a.opponent_link }}). {% endif %}[Compare this situation with another game](../../compare/?b={{ a.date }}).

Author: {{ author }}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro snapshot_status_line(a, files, author, kind) -%}
**{% if a.competition == 'LBA' %}LBA: {{ a.record }} · {{ a.position }}{{ a.position_suffix }} in the standings ({{ a.points }} points){% if a.record_ec %} · EuroCup: {{ a.record_ec }}{% endif %}{% else %}EuroCup: {{ a.standings_table.record or a.record_ec or '0-0' }}{% if a.standings_table.position %} · {{ a.standings_table.position }}{{ a.standings_table.position_suffix }} of {{ a.standings_table.teams }} in its group{% endif %} · LBA: {{ a.record }} · {{ a.position }}{{ a.position_suffix }} in the standings ({{ a.points }} points){% endif %} · last five games (both competitions): {{ a.form }}**
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro last_results(a, files, author, kind) -%}
{{ a.md.last_results }}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro snapshot_standings(a, files, author, kind) -%}
{% if a.standings_table.available %}{{ a.standings_table.kind if a.standings_table.kind != 'LBA' else 'LBA' }} standings before this game{% if a.competition != 'LBA' %} (the group of {{ a.team }}){% endif %}:

![standings](standings.png)

<details><summary>Standings table</summary>

{{ a.md.standings }}

</details>{% else %}EuroCup standings are not available yet: they are computed from the EuroCup results (`data/eurocup/results.csv`), which the daily run fetches from the EuroLeague API.{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro last_game(a, files, author, kind) -%}
{{ a.last_game.competition }}{% if a.last_game.round %} round {{ a.last_game.round }}{% endif %}, {{ 'at' if a.last_game.home is false else 'vs' }} {{ a.last_game.opponent }} ({{ a.last_game.date }}): **{{ 'win' if a.last_game.win else 'loss' }} {{ a.last_game.score_for }}-{{ a.last_game.score_against }}**.

{% if a.playing_time %}Significant increase in playing time in that game (at least 8' played and either +7' or +30% versus the average in earlier games):

| Player | Last game | Average before | Change |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
{% for f in a.playing_time %}| {{ f.name }} | {{ f.now|round(0)|int }}' | {% if f.avg is none %}no minutes before{% else %}{{ f.avg|round(0)|int }}' ({{ f.gp_before }} GP){% endif %} | {% if f.diff is none %}new{% else %}{{ '%+d'|format(f.diff|round(0)|int) }}' ({{ '%+d'|format(f.pct) }}%){% endif %} |
{% endfor %}{% else %}No player had a significant increase in playing time in that game (flag: at least 8' played and either +7' or +30% versus the average in earlier games).{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro team_numbers(a, files, author, kind) -%}
| | LBA | EuroCup |
|---|---:|---:|
{% for k, v in a.profile.LBA.items() %}| {{ k }} | {{ v }} | {{ a.profile.EuroCup.get(k, '–') if a.profile.EuroCup else '–' }} |
{% endfor %}
Ratings are points per 100 possessions. eFG% = (2P + 1.5 × 3P) / FGA · TOV% = turnovers per 100 possessions · OREB% = share of available offensive rebounds · FT rate = free throw attempts per field goal attempt.
{%- endmacro %}

