Passer (rows) to scorer (columns), assisted baskets linked in the LBA play-by-play, games before this one. Most frequent pairs: {% for t in a.assist_top[:5] %}{{ t.passer }} → {{ t.scorer }} ({{ t.n }}){{ ', ' if not loop.last else '.' }}{% endfor %}
{%- endmacro %}

