{# ─── opponent analysis ─── #}
{% macro analysis_header(a, files, author, kind) -%}
Round {{ a.round }} · {{ a.date_long }}, {{ a.time }}{% if a.venue %} · {{ a.venue }}{% endif %}

**Pre-game analysis: only data from games played before {{ a.date_long }}.** League games{% if a.eurocup %} and EuroCup games{% endif %}; early in the season the samples are small, so read everything as tendencies, not established facts.{% if a.team_link %} The situation of {{ a.team }} before this game is [here]({{ a.team_link }}).{% endif %}

Author: {{ author }}
